## Core socket

Chestplate Mk2 and up holds one core. The bonus needs all four pieces worn, Mk2 or better.

| Core | Bonus |
|---|---|
| [[magma_core]] | fire immunity, hits set targets on fire, lava doesn't slow you, Jet Assist heats half as fast |
| [[antigrav_core]] | no fall damage, Flight costs half, Dash cooldown halved |

{{image shots/22_wireless_charger.jpg|A Wireless Charger charging an Exo-Frame}}

{{guide modules}}

Fit modules at a [[tinkers_bench]].

- FE gear takes no enchantments: modules replace them. The Age 0 tools (Tinker's Hammer, Felling Axe, Gearblade) still take enchantments.
- One of each kind per item. Level II and III are crafted from the level below and need a higher Age or Mk.
- Overclock, Fortune and Silk Touch only work while the tool has FE.

{{image shots/gui_tinkers_bench.jpg|Tinker's Bench with a Null Drill and five modules}}

